  4) CANDLE C: CLOSES ABOVE candle B's high...
  5) ...and is GREEN.
  6) SMA50 today > SMA50 20 trading days ago.
  7) Stop (lower of B/C lows) at least 1.0% below the entry.

  signal_lookback_days = 1  (1 = C must be the latest candle)

